OL,3,GNEWSAPupils 'proud' to attend Sir
OL,4,APatrick's old school
OL,5,
OL,6,FPupils at a West Yorkshire school where
OL,7,FSir Patrick Stewart once studied have
OL,8,Fsaid they are "proud" to follow in his
OL,9,Ffootsteps.
OL,11,FThe Hollywood star went to Mirfield
OL,12,FFree Grammar, where students know him
OL,13,Fthrough his roles in the X-Men films
OL,14,Fand Shakespeare.
OL,16,FSir Patrick died last week, aged 86,
OL,17,Fafter suffering from Alzheimer's
OL,18,Fdisease and Lewy Body Dementia.
OL,20,FNeal Packard, vice-principal of
OL,21,FMirfield, said the news was "a big
OL,22,Fshock" to the school.
